00:04:30.549 --> 00:04:34.409
Reservation holders have waited nearly nine years without a delivered vehicle.

00:04:34.829 --> 00:04:41.649
Starting in April 2027, China cuts the value added tax or VAT export rebate on new energy

00:04:41.649 --> 00:04:44.389
vehicles from 13% to 9%.

00:04:44.389 --> 00:04:48.969
That change lands on every Shanghai built Model 3 and Model Y sent abroad.

00:04:49.569 --> 00:04:56.149
At an average export value of 220,000 yuan, the gap is about 8,800 yuan per vehicle.

00:04:56.149 --> 00:05:02.289
Electric estimates that could run Tesla around $600 million a year at current export volumes.

00:05:02.889 --> 00:05:06.149
Gigashang High now ships 49% of output overseas.

00:05:06.749 --> 00:05:12.689
That share was 29% a year earlier, so the thinner rebate hits a much larger slice of the factory.

00:05:13.329 --> 00:05:16.509
Domestic sales were down 11.9% through September.

00:05:17.029 --> 00:05:22.849
When the home market softens, the plants utilization leans on export margins that just got structurally narrower.

00:05:22.849 --> 00:05:28.029
Tesla can try to absorb the hit with scale or raise prices in destination markets.

00:05:28.429 --> 00:05:33.129
Either path runs into BYD and GLE, which face the same cost increase.

00:05:33.749 --> 00:05:39.469
Gross margin on each exported car comes under pressure unless sell-cost fall or other plants run harder.

00:05:40.441 --> 00:05:44.821
The cut also changes how Tesla weighs new capacity in China against other regions.

00:05:45.381 --> 00:05:49.741
A factory built for one continent now carries more policy risk when it serves many.

00:05:49.741 --> 00:05:54.461
low or bill of materials cost is one of the few offsets that does not depend on

00:05:54.461 --> 00:05:59.581
raising price. The rebate change is not a one-off squeeze. It is a recurring signal

00:05:59.581 --> 00:06:04.797
that export heavy manufacturing carries a regulatory cost of its own. Before we

00:06:04.797 --> 00:06:09.137
go, the remote-operated roadster prototype is due on camera tomorrow night if

00:06:09.137 --> 00:06:13.077
